<title>USA: Bank of New York sets $300 mln capital secs.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York sets $300 mln capital secs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities, a trust preferred issue, from Bank of New York Co Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK OF NEW YORK CO INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.97 PCT   MATURITY 12/31/2026</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 6/31/1997 LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.97 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 126 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
